# Box a unifies only with Box a: a string and a nested vector do not
# join, and nothing is boxed or unboxed implicitly.
== SOURCE
"ab" c_at "cd" "ef"
== ERROR
error[type-mismatch]: expected Char, found Box Char
 --> -e:1:1
  |
1 | "ab" c_at "cd" "ef"
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  | ---- a string: a vector of Char
  |           --------- this is a Box Char
  = note: `c_at` has type a -> a -> a
